    "problemName": "target-sum",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def findTargetSumWays(self, nums: List[int], target: int) -> int:\r\n        s = sum(nums)\r\n        if s < target or (s - target) % 2:\r\n            return 0\r\n        m, n = len(nums), (s - target) // 2\r\n        f = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)]\r\n        f[0][0] = 1\r\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums, 1):\r\n            for j in range(n + 1):\r\n                f[i][j] = f[i - 1][j]\r\n                if j >= x:\r\n                    f[i][j] += f[i - 1][j - x]\r\n        return f[m][n]",
